### ==========================================
### 🧾 SERVICE FEE: RUN THESE IN ORDER (A → H)
### ==========================================

### A. Read the current service fee (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### B. Set the service fee to 2.5% (creates the setting if it doesn't exist yet, otherwise updates it)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 1.5,
  "flat": 0
}

### C. Buyer checkout totals, M-Pesa (total is rounded up to whole shillings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkout-totals?bookingId={{bookingId}}&method=mpesa

### D. Buyer checkout totals, card (exact cents, no rounding)
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkout-totals?bookingId={{bookingId}}&method=card

### E. Create a payment and check the response has serviceFee, serviceFeePercent and totalCharged
###    (amount is left out on purpose, so it is read from the booking)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "paymentMethod": "M-Pesa",
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "SVC-TEST-001",
  "orgId": {{orgId}}
}

### F. Change the fee to 3% + 10 flat, then re-run C: the totals should change with NO code change
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 3,
  "flat": 10
}

### G. Validation tests: both of these should return 400
### G1. Percent too high
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 80,
  "flat": 0
}

### G2. Negative flat fee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 2.5,
  "flat": -5
}

### H. Set it back to 2.5% when you're done testing
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/service-fee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 2.5,
  "flat": 0
}

### Missing / unknown bookingId should return 400 / 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkout-totals

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkout-totals?bookingId=999999&method=mpesa

### ==========================================
### 🚀 PAYSTACK GATEWAY & STATUS ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 1. Check Booking Payment Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking-status/{{bookingId}}

### 2. Paystack: direct M-Pesa prompt (body fields are a guess, match your handlePaystackMpesa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/paystack/mpesa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "254112310754",
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}}
}

### 3. Paystack: hosted checkout (body fields are a guess, match your initializePaystackPayment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/paystack/initialize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "email": "buyer@example.com"
}

### 4. Paystack: verify a payment by reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/paystack/verify/TS-122-1792009610531

### ==========================================
### 📊 ANALYTICS & STATS ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 5. Platform earnings: organizer commission only
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/platform-earnings

### 6. 🆕 Platform earnings: buyer service fees only (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/service-fee-earnings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. 🆕 Total platform revenue: commission + service fees (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/total-revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Event total revenue (ticket sales only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/event-revenue/14

### 9. Successful payments count
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/successful-count

### 9b. Successful payments count for one organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/successful-count?orgId={{orgId}}

### ==========================================
### 📋 CORE PAYMENT CRUD & FILTER ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 10. Get All Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 11. Create Manual Payment Record (explicit amount; if it is more than the booking total it is capped to the booking total)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "M-Pesa",
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "QWE12345",
  "orgId": {{orgId}}
}

### 12. Create Manual Payment Record (amount auto-fetched from the booking)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": {{bookingId}},
  "paymentMethod": "M-Pesa",
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "QWE1234567453",
  "orgId": {{orgId}}
}

### 13. Get Payment By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 14. Update Payment Record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "paymentMethod": "Stripe"
}

### 15. Update Payment Status (Patch)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentStatus": "Completed",
  "transactionId": "MOCK_TXN_987654",
  "resultCode": "0",
  "resultDesc": "The service request is processed successfully."
}

### 16. Filter Payments by Booking ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking/{{bookingId}}

### 17. Filter Payments by Event ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/event/1

### 18. Filter Payments by Organization ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/org/4

### 19. Filter Payments by User Digital ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/1

### 20. Filter Payments by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/Pending

### 21. Filter Payments by Method
GET {{baseUrl}}/method/M-Pesa

### 22. Delete Payment Record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1